OL,4,G0630FTim Lihoreau
OL,5,     GTim Lihoreau has the perfect
OL,6,     Gclassical music to get you up in
OL,7,     Gthe morning, with all the news
OL,8,     Gand travel updates you need to
OL,9,     Gknow, plus the Hall of Fame Hour
OL,10,     Gat 9am.
OL,11,G0900FThe Classic FM Hall of Fame Hour
OL,12,     GTim brings you an hour of the
OL,13,     Gbiggest classical hits from the
OL,14,     GClassic FM Hall of Fame - the
OL,15,     Gannual Top 300 chart voted for by
OL,16,     Gyou.
